desc:
Address: 6515 Marguerite St. Vancouver.
Available: July 1st 2026
Rent: $2300/monthly; one year lease minimum, month to month afterwards;

Utility: water is included; gas and hydro are not included;

Unit description: half-basement with great natural light; separate entrance; two big size bedroom; one washroom; well-equipped kitchen; one living room and dining room; central air conditioning;

Location description: Near to 49th and Marguerite St; #49 bus directly to UBC or Langara College or Metrotown; 10 mins walk to Kerrisdale community shops; few mins walk to restaurants and supermarkets;

School catchment: Maple Grove Elementary; Magee Secondary;

Requirement: credit check and reference check are required to provide; no pet; non-smoking.

If you are interested, please click the top left "REPLY" with answering the questions below:
House ID: Marguerite St. 
-Your name;
-Occupation;
-Who you are gonna live with;
-Do you have pet;
-Expected moving in date;
-Reasons to move;
-List your phone number or email to contact? 

Thank you.
